---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: Placement test
description: A short spoken test for each subject that finds the lesson a child should begin with.
permalink: /placement/
bodyClass: page-placement
---
<header class="screen__head">
  <h1 class="screen__title">Placement test</h1>
  <p class="screen__lead">A set of short sections, each checking one span of lessons. The child goes on until a section is not passed, and the test names the lesson to start with. Most children finish in ten to twenty minutes.</p>
</header>

<div data-child-picker></div>

<ul class="rows">
  {% for s in program.subjects %}
  <li>
    <a class="row" href="{{ s.placementUrl }}">
      <span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">{{ s.name }}</span><span class="row__sub">{{ s.placementNote }}</span></span>
      {% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="muted small">Read each question aloud, let the child answer, and mark Firm or Error. Do not correct or help.</p>

<script src="/assets/js/progress.js?v={{ build.version }}"></script>
